---
layout: base.njk
title: Costs
wide: true
description: "Open operating-cost ledger: cash, forecasts, reserves and noncash time kept separate. Unknown means unknown."
---
<p class="kicker">Open books · Quartermaster ledger 0.1 draft</p>
<h1>What this costs</h1>
<p class="lede">If we can explain how to run it, we should explain what it costs.</p>
<div class="notice">
  <p><strong>{{ costs.summary.statement }}</strong></p>
  <p>As of {{ costs.as_of_utc }}. {{ costs.note }} Source: <a href="{% sourceLink "launch/costs.json" %}"><code>launch/costs.json</code></a>, which <code>qm validate</code> checks on every build (<a href="/costs/ledger.json">machine-readable copy</a>, <a href="/spec/quartermaster/">format</a>).</p>
</div>

{% macro amount(v) %}{% if v === null %}<span class="badge unknown">unknown</span>{% else %}${{ v | round(2) }}{% endif %}{% endmacro %}

{% for cat, label in costs.categories %}
{% set rows = [] %}{% for e in costs.entries %}{% if e.category == cat %}{% set rows = (rows.push(e), rows) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% if rows.length %}
<h2>{{ label }} <small>(<code>{{ cat }}</code>)</small></h2>
<div class="table-scroll"><table>
  <thead><tr><th scope="col">Item</th><th scope="col">Provider</th>{% if cat == "donated-labor" or cat == "user-attention" %}<th scope="col">Hours</th>{% endif %}<th scope="col">Amount ({{ costs.currency }})</th><th scope="col">Date</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">Source</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {%- for e in rows %}
    <tr><td>{{ e.item }}</td><td>{{ e.provider }}</td>{% if cat == "donated-labor" or cat == "user-attention" %}<td class="num">{% if e.hours === null %}<span class="badge unknown">unmeasured</span>{% else %}{{ e.hours }}{% endif %}</td>{% endif %}<td class="num">{{ amount(e.amount) }}</td><td>{{ e.date or "—" }}{% if e.recurrence %} · {{ e.recurrence }}{% endif %}</td><td>{{ e.status }}</td><td>{{ costs.sourceById[e.source].description }}</td></tr>
  {%- endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table></div>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

<h2>Human attention</h2>
<p>No method or hourly rate has been adopted, so time is shown as unmeasured rather than given a price. <a href="/charter/#human-attention">Human Attention Accounting</a> is an open proposal.</p>

<h2>Propose a saving</h2>
<p>Know a cheaper or sturdier way to run this? Open a pull request using the <a href="{{ repoUrl }}/blob/main/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE/propose-a-saving.md">propose-a-saving template</a>, with before-and-after unit costs, your estimate method, the risks, and how we'd measure the result afterwards. Nothing is auto-deployed.</p>
